        {
          "text": "Kandi kur’ uwo musi muzovuga, muti Ni mukengurukire Uhoraho, mwambaze izina ryiwe, mwamamaze ibikorwa vyiwe mu mahanga, mumenyekanishe izina ryiwe ko rishizwe hejuru. ",
